Z||000002||Patrick||01-31-2000||11:55 PM||||<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.daxcars.co.uk/kamala/images/kamala1.jpg"> <P>The <B>DAX Kamala</B> is an interesting looking car, but some of the hype at their website is pretty funny. Would you believe that this car with its open front wheel fenders is described as "the totally practical all weather sports car". I doubt this car would be too "practical" on wet roads with it's front tires spraying water and road crud up all over the place. In a turn, the inside front tire would probably be lobbing ground water and dirt right onto the windshield.<P>I'd be happy to drive it on a dry road though... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||02-01-2000||01:03 AM||||ISH...<P>what a strange-ish name.. kinda weird-ish, don't ya think? pretty cool-ish looking car tho.. looks F355-ish.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.ish-car.co.uk/GALLERY6.JPG"> <P>Check out the warp drive on the first photo.. you can tell it's a warp drive because the back of the car is going faster than the front, so that's why it's blurred, and the front isn't.<P>pretty cool-ish.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 02-01-2000).]||||reg||1
